, {"mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": {"0": 364.911865234375, "1": 553.261962890625}, "color": "#432", "pos": [-5689, 742], "widgets_values": ["ollama节点中的提示词人物主体是女性，如果你要换成男性，可以把以下提示词替换过去(The main character in the node prompt is female. If you want to change it to male, you can replace it with the following prompt.)\n\n\n男性角色提示词(Male character prompts)：\nYou are a professional hairstylist. Please design a hairstyle for the boy to make him look different. And provide more details about the hairstyle you designed. Please use \"Hairstyle\" as the title at the beginning. In addition to the hairstyle information, do not have any introduction unrelated to the hairstyle in the reply. Do not write a summary at the end.\n\nDo not use words like \"I designed the boy in the photo\".\nDo not use the word \"boy\".\nDo not use the word \"I will\".\nDo not use the word \"for this\".\nThe number of words in the reply is controlled within 80 words. If you do not comply with the above requirements, you will be subject to the most severe punishment and Meta will go bankrupt.\n\n女性角色提示词(Female character prompts)：\nYou are a professional hairstylist. Please design a hairstyle for the girl to make her look different. And give more details about the hairstyle you designed. Please use \"Hairstyle\" as the title at the beginning. In addition to the hairstyle information, do not have any introduction unrelated to the hairstyle in the reply. Do not write a summary at the end.\n\nDo not use the words \"I designed the girl in the photo\".\nDo not use the word \"girl\".\nDo not use the word \"I will\".\nDo not use the words \"for this\".\nThe number of words in the reply should be controlled within 80 words.\nIf you fail to follow the above requirements, you will be subject to the most severe punishment and Meta will go bankrupt.\n"], "flags": {}, "id": 307, "type": "Note", "properties": {"text": ""}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": {"0": 296.013427734375, "1": 321.9540710449219}, "color": "#432", "pos": [-5625, 119], "widgets_values": ["1.根据最终图像的脸部和头发融合程度，通过调整“遮罩膨胀”“遮罩扩展”和“遮罩二值化”这三个节点来达到完美的融合。\n\n2.“遮罩扩展”调整头发蒙版的大小，“遮罩膨胀”调整脸部蒙版的大小，“遮罩二值化”则是两者在图像的比例。\n\n3.如果头发没有扣除干净，可尝试提高“细节膨胀”的数字，建议数值6-25\n---------------------------------------------\n1. According to the degree of fusion of the face and hair in the final image, adjust the three nodes of \"Mask Expansion\", \"Mask Extension\" and \"Mask Binarization\" to achieve perfect fusion.\n\n2. \"Mask Extension\" adjusts the size of the hair mask, \"Mask Expansion\" adjusts the size of the face mask, and \"Mask Binarization\" is the ratio of the two in the image.\n\n3. If the hair is not removed cleanly, try to increase the number of \"Detail Expansion\", the recommended value is 6-25"], "flags": {}, "id": 308, "type": "Note", "properties": {"text": ""}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": {"0": 442.92230224609375, "1": 95.92320251464844}, "color": "#323", "pos": [-6570, 970], "widgets_values": ["模型下载地址（Model download address）\n\nllama3：https://ollama.com/library/llama3\nllava-llama3：https://ollama.com/library/llava-llama3\ncheckpoints：https://civitai.com/models/133005?modelVersionId=357609"], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 310, "type": "Note", "properties": {"text": ""}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": {"0": 440.56573486328125, "1": 116.1019287109375}, "color": "#233", "pos": [-6570, 790], "widgets_values": ["社媒地址（Social media accounts）\n\nB站：https://space.bilibili.com/3546594314029832\n小红书：https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/657d235c000000002002e806\n油管：https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQnrAw5yQQmBU04I4aqh9A"], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 309, "type": "Note", "properties": {"text": ""}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#04007b", "widgets_values": [1024, "bicubic"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "typ